              },
              "contextSpan": "If the readiness probe fails, the pod will be marked unready and will not receive traffic from any services. To try the TCP liveness check, create a Pod: kubectl apply -f https://k8s.io/examples/pods/probe/tcp-liveness-readiness.yaml After 15 seconds, view Pod events to verify that liveness probes: kubectl describe pod goproxy Define a gRPC liveness probe Feature state: Stable since Kubernetes v1.27 If your application implements the gRPC Health Checking Protocol",
